# Paths the deploy must not publish.
#
# These sites build into the repository root rather than into a dist/ folder,
# so that every page sits one URL segment deep with no prefix to strip. The
# consequence is that the deploy directory IS the repository, and the
# toolchain sits beside the site unless it is named here.
#
# node_modules is the one that actually breaks the deploy: ~3,800 files, and
# workerd inside it is 137 MiB against Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-file limit.
# The rest are excluded because serving build inputs is pointless weight.
#
# Everything NOT listed here is published: index.html, the six locale folders,
# the landing-page folders, assets/, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, _headers and
# _redirects.

node_modules
scripts
src
docs
marketing
package.json
package-lock.json
tailwind.config.js
README.md
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.toml
.wrangler
.landing-manifest.json
